}
<div data-admin-users-page>
    <header class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT MANAGEMENT</p><h1>Qu&#7843;n l&#253; ng&#432;&#7901;i d&#249;ng</h1><p>L&#7885;c theo vai tr&#242; v&#224; tr&#7841;ng th&#225;i t&#224;i kho&#7843;n; kh&#243;a ho&#7863;c m&#7903; kh&#243;a qua API admin.</p></div></header>
